ilya2@rcn.com wrote:
> 1. Can you keep the priest at bay with pits instead of boulders? Will
> he still cast spells on you or, worse, somehow get across the pits?

The priest will never cross a pit, so you can definitely immobilize him
that way.  Two caveats:  First, as Link pointed out, you need to keep
your distance or he'll start casting spells.  Second, the town guards
will get angry if they wander into your pit.  They also get angry if
you attack the priest, so presumably you'd neutralize them first
anyway.

> 2. Do you lose alignment (as some claimed) or gain alignment for
> killing a priest of another faith?

You lose alignment, whether chaotic or not.  Non-chaotics also lose
telepathy and 2 luck.



